WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.260 --> 01:39.020
[Episode 28]

01:39.230 --> 01:41.050
Everything about this seems off.

01:42.120 --> 01:43.260
He probably figured

01:43.510 --> 01:44.740
the food here wasn't to his taste,

01:45.200 --> 01:46.260
so he went to find lighter dishes.

01:46.920 --> 01:48.100
In Jin City,

01:48.560 --> 01:49.540
where can you find light dishes?

01:50.200 --> 01:51.020
Perhaps

01:52.000 --> 01:52.900
the Tang Clan?

01:53.230 --> 01:54.380
Why did he go there?

01:55.070 --> 01:55.910
You guys came here

01:55.920 --> 01:57.180
to negotiate a deal with us.

01:57.560 --> 01:59.120
If you guys are visiting Tang Clan,

01:59.120 --> 01:59.900
the deal between us

01:59.900 --> 02:00.820
is off!

02:04.120 --> 02:05.660
You really think we're taking this negotiation seriously?

02:06.680 --> 02:08.220
Now that Xuewei has returned,

02:08.680 --> 02:09.610
the negotiation

02:10.280 --> 02:11.380
is off.

02:12.030 --> 02:12.570
You!

02:12.800 --> 02:14.290
Didn't the intel you guys gathered inform you

02:14.590 --> 02:15.890
that I wasn't a credible individual?

02:16.560 --> 02:17.500
I never said

02:17.680 --> 02:18.730
that I would keep my promise.

02:19.190 --> 02:20.100
Patriarch,

02:21.470 --> 02:22.820
what exactly do you want?

02:24.030 --> 02:26.060
We wish to get out of the dark and nefarious Blood River.

02:27.310 --> 02:29.290
But judging from Tang Clan's current situation,

02:30.280 --> 02:31.780
it's just like Blood River.

02:42.900 --> 02:46.940
[Lianyue Pavilion]

02:51.840 --> 02:53.260
I'll go and check out the brat in the cell.

02:53.750 --> 02:54.610
Keep guard over here.

02:55.080 --> 02:56.540
Notify me immediately if there are any movements.

02:59.080 --> 02:59.730
Be careful.

03:01.280 --> 03:02.100
Isn't that Tang Tianlu?

03:02.630 --> 03:03.290
If we fight him,

03:04.120 --> 03:04.730
the commotion will definitely

03:04.910 --> 03:05.730
attract all of their members here.

03:06.150 --> 03:07.690
We have to lure them away somehow.

03:08.910 --> 03:09.410
Please leave that task

03:09.960 --> 03:10.690
to me.

03:11.310 --> 03:12.730
I'll go and rescue Tang Lianyue's young disciple

03:12.750 --> 03:13.780
while I'm there.

03:14.190 --> 03:14.780
After all,

03:15.590 --> 03:16.690
he hasn't addressed Yumo

03:16.710 --> 03:17.540
as Madam yet.

03:18.310 --> 03:19.010
Be careful.

03:22.800 --> 03:23.340
Who's there?

03:23.870 --> 03:24.730
Keep guard here.

03:25.710 --> 03:26.500
Shadowshard Spider.

03:30.500 --> 03:33.660
[Lianyue Pavilion]

03:44.470 --> 03:45.010
Yu.

03:48.080 --> 03:48.820
I assume this was caused by

03:49.030 --> 03:50.130
the Frostmoon Cocoon.

03:51.520 --> 03:52.410
How can we rescue him?

03:53.080 --> 03:53.940
Try using the Embermark Spider.

04:02.500 --> 04:03.240
This is...

04:06.240 --> 04:06.940
What a joke.

04:07.520 --> 04:09.730
Frostmoon Cocoon is a rare artifact.

04:10.190 --> 04:11.690
You think you can

04:12.030 --> 04:12.730
dispel the frost

04:12.960 --> 04:14.780
covering Tang Lianyue with your Embermark Spider?

04:15.280 --> 04:17.020
Such wishful thinking.

04:28.070 --> 04:28.850
Hell Palm?

04:29.950 --> 04:31.250
I would've brought more men with me had I known this would happen.

04:32.040 --> 04:33.220
This is Jin City.

04:33.720 --> 04:35.490
You're going against the Tang Clan in Jin City.

04:35.870 --> 04:36.490
Patriarch,

04:37.040 --> 04:37.930
that's unwise

04:37.950 --> 04:39.170
of you.

04:39.600 --> 04:40.660
After all is said and done,

04:41.270 --> 04:42.370
you guys just outnumber us.

04:42.800 --> 04:44.050
The winner takes all!

04:44.240 --> 04:46.050
Do you think you can win just because you outnumber us?

05:07.480 --> 05:08.610
Master Su,

05:09.120 --> 05:10.340
you do bring us

05:10.560 --> 05:12.660
endless surprises.

05:15.120 --> 05:16.250
The hidden weapon is laced with a deadly toxin.

05:17.120 --> 05:17.930
What a shame.

05:18.360 --> 05:20.580
It's too late for you to know that.

05:23.190 --> 05:23.930
You're quite talkative, aren't you?

05:24.560 --> 05:25.490
Now, you'll experience the pain

05:25.510 --> 05:26.610
of being unable to talk.

05:30.040 --> 05:30.660
It's not too late.

05:31.310 --> 05:32.730
I arrived in the nick of time.

05:34.360 --> 05:34.930
Miss Bai?

05:35.830 --> 05:36.460
Uncle Zhe?

05:37.360 --> 05:38.050
What are you guys doing here?

05:38.390 --> 05:40.490
I received a distress signal from Baicao.

05:40.870 --> 05:42.370
He was trapped in Tang Clan as well.

05:43.830 --> 05:44.850
But right now,

05:45.120 --> 05:46.220
you should let me

05:46.430 --> 05:47.410
check your pulse.

05:54.720 --> 05:55.340
This toxin

05:55.720 --> 05:57.140
is the same as the toxin in Xuewei's body.

06:00.000 --> 06:00.980
Could it be that she's in trouble?

06:02.000 --> 06:03.220
She was taken away by Night Crow before this.

06:04.510 --> 06:05.250
I knew it.

06:05.950 --> 06:07.660
Although my martial niece harbored

06:07.680 --> 06:08.490
sinister thoughts,

06:08.600 --> 06:09.660
she's exceptionally intelligent.

06:10.120 --> 06:11.490
A near-perfect toxic beauty

06:11.680 --> 06:12.490
was in her hands.

06:13.000 --> 06:14.170
I suppose she could extract the toxin

06:14.190 --> 06:14.810
within her

06:15.040 --> 06:16.290
and use it for other purposes.

06:18.000 --> 06:18.730
This toxin is difficult to neutralize.

06:19.870 --> 06:21.140
This pill will suppress it for now.

06:21.430 --> 06:22.250
I'll neutralize the poison for you

06:22.600 --> 06:23.580
once we leave this place.

06:38.870 --> 06:39.580
Thank you, Miss Bai.

06:41.040 --> 06:41.410
Miss Bai,

06:42.120 --> 06:43.610
do you have a way to rescue Tang Lianyue?

06:48.920 --> 06:50.260
The Frostmoon Cocoon, huh?

06:51.600 --> 06:52.170
I have an idea.

06:53.040 --> 06:53.610
How should we rescue him?

06:56.600 --> 06:57.460
I'll try using Ember.

06:58.950 --> 07:01.250
I suppose snakes devour cocoons, right?

07:02.630 --> 07:03.490
I think so.

07:04.430 --> 07:05.780
What kind of snake is Ember?

07:06.270 --> 07:07.100
A Phoenix Flame Serpent.

07:09.160 --> 07:10.020
This is Ember.

07:16.300 --> 07:18.260
Ember isn't as obedient as Green.

07:18.800 --> 07:20.250
It knew that my calling would surely mean trouble.

07:20.920 --> 07:21.900
That's why it isn't willing to work.

07:33.160 --> 07:33.850
That's more like it.

07:34.160 --> 07:34.810
Get to work.

07:55.750 --> 07:56.370
I think the room

07:57.120 --> 07:58.700
isn't as cold now.

08:01.120 --> 08:01.700
Yeah.

08:02.800 --> 08:03.410
And,

08:04.600 --> 08:05.730
it's getting warmer by the second.

08:06.920 --> 08:08.290
If we have the Celestial Sea Flame Spider,

08:08.630 --> 08:09.580
Tang Lianyue

08:09.680 --> 08:10.850
would've returned to normal by now.

08:11.460 --> 08:12.350
Although Ember

08:12.390 --> 08:14.560
is a rare flame-attribute mystical snake,

08:14.840 --> 08:16.110
it'll take at least four hours

08:16.380 --> 08:17.740
for it

08:18.120 --> 08:19.460
to melt all of the ice here.

08:20.070 --> 08:21.660
He'll return to normal eventually.

08:22.390 --> 08:23.050
However,

08:23.430 --> 08:24.780
he won't regain consciousness just yet.

08:31.190 --> 08:32.100
It's a shame

08:32.720 --> 08:34.700
that you guys won't have the time to do so.

08:36.510 --> 08:37.890
You're already dead

08:38.200 --> 08:39.460
- when the Storm Pear Blossom Needles... - Watch out!

08:40.630 --> 08:42.010
...is pointing at you.

09:17.870 --> 09:18.300
Miss Bai,

09:19.000 --> 09:19.530
please examine him.

09:22.510 --> 09:23.340
I didn't do that.

09:23.640 --> 09:25.420
It'll take at least half an hour

09:25.460 --> 09:26.580
for ordinary people

09:26.870 --> 09:28.580
to regain their movements in this situation.

09:29.080 --> 09:30.250
Miss Bai, you were referring to ordinary people.

09:31.240 --> 09:32.300
But he's Tang Lianyue.

09:38.720 --> 09:39.340
Yes.

09:40.510 --> 09:41.580
I'm Tang Lianyue.

09:42.030 --> 09:42.850
You're finally awake.

09:47.320 --> 09:48.370
Never would I have imagined

09:49.320 --> 09:50.220
that the ones to come and save me

09:51.240 --> 09:52.010
would be you all.

09:52.790 --> 09:53.950
What do you mean by that?

09:54.440 --> 09:55.950
Shouldn't you think of me at the first time

09:55.950 --> 09:57.100
when you were ambushed?

09:58.480 --> 09:59.130
It's you?

10:00.550 --> 10:02.230
What do you mean by that?

10:03.000 --> 10:03.650
Who am I?

10:04.480 --> 10:05.060
Mu Yumo.

10:05.600 --> 10:07.010
He answered that directly, huh?

10:07.010 --> 10:08.340
That was pretty surprising.

10:08.750 --> 10:09.370
Yeah.

10:10.840 --> 10:11.820
He's Tang Lianyue after all.

10:25.120 --> 10:25.770
Martial Uncle,

10:27.440 --> 10:28.300
I want to know why you're doing this.

10:29.360 --> 10:31.490
You guys support Tang Linghuang.

10:32.750 --> 10:34.700
We do not want

10:35.670 --> 10:36.460
Tang Linghuang

10:36.510 --> 10:38.420
to become the next grand master.

10:39.030 --> 10:40.770
But the address of Tang Clan's Wanbao Tower

10:42.750 --> 10:43.940
is only known to

10:44.870 --> 10:46.220
Grand Master Tang, Senior Brother, and me.

10:47.510 --> 10:48.730
Is that why you guys

10:49.960 --> 10:50.850
trapped us here

10:50.870 --> 10:52.060
without killing us?

10:52.550 --> 10:53.610
Within Wanbao Tower

10:54.480 --> 10:55.220
contains

10:55.480 --> 10:57.730
all heaven-rank hidden weapons of the Tang Clan.

10:58.790 --> 10:59.940
Without them,

11:00.960 --> 11:03.320
it'll be difficult for Tang Clan

11:03.320 --> 11:05.070
to maintain its position

11:05.870 --> 11:07.060
in the martial world.

11:09.410 --> 11:11.610
Although you're free now,

11:12.600 --> 11:14.130
Tang Linghuang and Tang Lian

11:14.360 --> 11:15.730
are still in our hands.

11:16.840 --> 11:18.460
If you try anything funny,

11:19.360 --> 11:21.700
we can kill them at any time.

11:23.000 --> 11:24.180
So, it turns out that the term "hypocrite"

11:24.360 --> 11:25.100
in the so-called righteous sects

11:25.840 --> 11:26.980
was used to describe someone like you.

11:28.510 --> 11:29.980
You used one's sense of justice

11:30.120 --> 11:31.420
and loyalty to blackmail your own member

11:31.790 --> 11:33.530
in order to achieve your despicable goal.

11:34.910 --> 11:36.130
However, a true gentleman

11:36.240 --> 11:37.100
is annoying as well.

11:37.870 --> 11:39.370
After all, they would yield to someone like you.

11:48.600 --> 11:49.490
Mu Qingyang has already found

11:50.440 --> 11:51.650
your young disciple.

12:06.510 --> 12:07.370
What do you guys want?

12:09.910 --> 12:12.120
Tell me the address of Wanbao Tower,

12:12.670 --> 12:14.230
and I'll make sure that you and Tang Linghuang

12:14.270 --> 12:16.060
can leave Tang Clan safely.

12:16.510 --> 12:17.490
Where's Grand Master Tang?

12:18.360 --> 12:20.610
He won't return to Tang Clan again.

12:21.600 --> 12:22.370
What do you mean by that?

12:25.720 --> 12:26.530
Don't worry.

12:27.170 --> 12:28.840
We won't do anything

12:28.840 --> 12:29.820
to him.

12:30.390 --> 12:32.770
It's just that he's unable to return to Tang Clan again.

12:33.670 --> 12:34.850
That is all.

12:36.030 --> 12:36.820
Don't believe in his nonsense.

12:37.630 --> 12:38.650
You might fall for his trap again.

12:41.910 --> 12:43.720
Senior Brother once told me this.

12:45.200 --> 12:46.100
What did he tell you?

12:47.550 --> 12:48.820
No matter when,

12:50.550 --> 12:52.730
when someone blackmails me with his safety...

12:53.440 --> 12:54.700
If I'm in any danger,

12:55.630 --> 12:56.940
if anyone blackmails you with my safety,

12:58.000 --> 12:59.060
you don't need to care.

12:59.510 --> 13:00.370
Just charge ahead.

13:00.910 --> 13:01.530
You'll never

13:01.870 --> 13:03.370
need to worry about me.

13:03.960 --> 13:04.770
I don't need to care.

13:05.750 --> 13:06.940
I can just charge ahead.

13:08.150 --> 13:08.820
It's because

13:10.840 --> 13:12.700
I'll never need to worry about him.

13:28.150 --> 13:28.940
Who are you?

13:30.240 --> 13:31.530
Not bad at all.

13:32.840 --> 13:33.730
What do you mean?

13:34.560 --> 13:36.220
You're a pretty good vessel.

13:45.920 --> 13:47.130
[Tang Linghuang, Tang Clan]
What are you up to?

13:48.720 --> 13:49.820
Your skills

13:49.910 --> 13:50.820
are much higher

13:50.910 --> 13:52.220
than all members

13:52.240 --> 13:53.330
of the Tang Clan.

13:53.440 --> 13:54.560
Who exactly are you?

13:56.500 --> 13:58.140
I'm just a passerby.

13:58.600 --> 13:59.420
I was passing by Tang Clan.

14:01.030 --> 14:02.420
Initially, I was here

14:02.790 --> 14:04.460
to complete a deal as per the order I received.

14:04.910 --> 14:06.730
They would ensure my safety,

14:06.820 --> 14:08.370
and provide me with a secret area

14:08.790 --> 14:09.980
and herbs for my experiment.

14:10.480 --> 14:13.100
I would help them seize power in the sect.

14:13.670 --> 14:14.980
But now, it seems like

14:15.870 --> 14:16.890
the deal

14:18.080 --> 14:19.220
might not stand.

14:20.150 --> 14:21.340
You see,

14:22.320 --> 14:24.420
I only like to join hands with the most powerful.

14:24.960 --> 14:26.060
It's a shame

14:26.360 --> 14:28.220
that the three strongest individuals of Tang Clan

14:28.600 --> 14:29.580
are hard to work with.

14:30.320 --> 14:32.010
I have no choice but to join hands with the second best.

14:51.030 --> 14:52.010
I've been living on thin ice

14:53.200 --> 14:54.300
ever since I arrived at Jin City.

14:55.610 --> 14:56.530
I wonder

14:58.080 --> 14:59.300
how things are going at Patriarch's side.

15:00.720 --> 15:02.010
I wonder if he has managed to rescue Xuewei.

15:13.670 --> 15:14.460
Madam's head of family,

15:15.080 --> 15:15.820
don't fall asleep.

15:16.120 --> 15:16.730
Please don't fall asleep!

15:18.430 --> 15:19.540
Don't worry.

15:20.220 --> 15:21.250
I won't die.

15:22.120 --> 15:23.340
It's just

15:23.840 --> 15:24.700
that killing

15:25.440 --> 15:26.490
Elder Tang Tianlu

15:27.240 --> 15:27.890
was too exhausting for me.

15:28.550 --> 15:29.370
Stop shaking me.

15:29.910 --> 15:30.730
Let me rest.

15:37.750 --> 15:38.460
Who are you two?

15:40.870 --> 15:41.490
Who are you?

15:42.030 --> 15:43.580
Shouldn't you answer my question first

15:44.240 --> 15:45.410
before you ask me

15:45.410 --> 15:46.320
any questions?

15:48.270 --> 15:49.180
Are you holding

15:51.320 --> 15:52.380
the third greatest sword in the world,

15:53.240 --> 15:54.180
Froststeel?

15:57.600 --> 15:58.900
Are you the second city lord of Xueyue City?

16:07.150 --> 16:08.020
The wound you've sustained

16:08.790 --> 16:10.260
is caused by the hidden weapons of Tang Clan.

16:15.270 --> 16:16.090
There was an internal struggle

16:17.910 --> 16:18.730
within Tang Clan.

16:19.550 --> 16:20.260
My master,

16:20.750 --> 16:22.180
also known as Xuanwu Guardian,

16:22.390 --> 16:23.500
he was frozen by them.

16:23.840 --> 16:25.450
It seems Mother was right.

16:26.120 --> 16:27.660
Tang Clan has fallen into chaos indeed.

16:39.600 --> 16:40.780
She's quite anxious, isn't she?

16:53.270 --> 16:54.140
It's over.

16:58.150 --> 16:59.260
Even if you guys

16:59.320 --> 17:00.260
defeat me,

17:00.910 --> 17:02.420
nothing in Tang Clan

17:03.150 --> 17:04.740
will change!

17:05.350 --> 17:06.220
Is that so?

17:08.750 --> 17:10.090
That's a signal from Yu.

17:11.920 --> 17:12.940
What a coincidence.

17:13.830 --> 17:14.650
It seems the result

17:15.400 --> 17:16.410
isn't what you expected it to be.

17:20.720 --> 17:21.740
Tang Fulu is dead.

17:22.720 --> 17:24.700
Tang Lingzun, your leader, cannot escape either.

17:25.440 --> 17:27.260
You guys merely executed her orders before this.

17:27.920 --> 17:29.460
I can let bygones be bygones.

17:29.940 --> 17:31.270
[Lianyue Pavilion]

17:31.270 --> 17:32.330
It's just that from now on,

17:33.030 --> 17:34.170
you guys may only serve your own interests

17:35.030 --> 17:36.460
or Tang Clan.

17:38.070 --> 17:40.130
Do not be the weapons of the faithless again.

17:44.510 --> 17:45.410
As you command.

17:49.240 --> 17:49.980
Guardian Lianyue.

17:51.720 --> 17:52.500
Get up and talk.

17:52.640 --> 17:53.300
Yes, sir.

17:55.590 --> 17:56.810
Where have you guys imprisoned the vice sect leader?

17:57.200 --> 17:57.810
The...

17:58.200 --> 17:59.410
In the Heaven Cell of the Execution Hall.

18:00.030 --> 18:00.700
Take me to him.

18:00.790 --> 18:01.410
Yes, sir.

18:01.510 --> 18:02.260
Take all of them away!

18:07.510 --> 18:08.130
Tang Lianyue.

18:15.590 --> 18:16.330
I've kept your Fingertip Blade

18:16.510 --> 18:17.500
for a long time.

18:18.310 --> 18:20.460
You should take it since you have business to deal with.

18:23.070 --> 18:24.460
I have extras on me.

18:25.680 --> 18:26.370
As for that blade,

18:28.000 --> 18:28.850
it only belongs to you,

18:29.920 --> 18:30.700
Ms. Yumo.

18:32.260 --> 18:36.780
♪Thoughts that never fade, year after year gazing from afar♪

18:36.820 --> 18:42.140
♪Whose longing guards this land unharmed?♪

18:42.300 --> 18:47.740
♪You are well, just as you were at the start♪

18:48.790 --> 18:49.850
What an unfaithful man.

18:50.270 --> 18:52.410
He returns to business immediately after regaining consciousness.

18:55.100 --> 19:00.220
♪Do not long for the sorrow of separation♪

19:00.750 --> 19:02.130
Tang Linghuang is imprisoned.

19:02.880 --> 19:03.540
The longer he's imprisoned,

19:04.030 --> 19:05.170
the more danger he'll face.

19:06.550 --> 19:07.220
I guess so.

19:08.790 --> 19:09.740
I was just saying.

19:17.680 --> 19:18.410
City Lord Li,

19:18.880 --> 19:19.780
to think that we actually meet again.

19:21.750 --> 19:22.410
You're here as well, huh?

19:23.240 --> 19:25.150
Were you guys involved in the uprising of Tang Clan as well?

19:26.590 --> 19:27.740
I'm here to keep my daughter company.

19:28.000 --> 19:29.460
Find him if you need anything.

19:31.640 --> 19:32.980
You must be here to rescue the Xuanwu Guardian.

19:34.480 --> 19:35.700
I suppose Xueyue City does have the duty

19:35.830 --> 19:36.850
of protecting the martial world.

19:37.550 --> 19:38.570
What has this got to do with me?

19:39.110 --> 19:40.460
I came here only because of Mother's request.

19:41.440 --> 19:42.740
Why are you guys here, then?

19:42.920 --> 19:44.410
That's the personal affair of Blood River.

19:45.480 --> 19:46.610
Xuanwu Guardian has been rescued.

19:47.270 --> 19:48.610
He's heading to Execution Hall.

19:49.070 --> 19:50.020
You may seek him out.

19:50.750 --> 19:51.700
Can I trust you?

19:52.720 --> 19:53.780
Whether you trust us or not doesn't matter.

19:54.310 --> 19:56.410
We've already achieved our goals.

20:05.400 --> 20:06.130
Let us move as well.

20:06.960 --> 20:07.570
Yu.

20:08.240 --> 20:09.020
Shouldn't we wait a little longer?

20:09.400 --> 20:10.020
No need for that.

20:10.640 --> 20:11.700
Xueyue Sword Deity has already arrived.

20:12.160 --> 20:13.500
There will be no more turmoil within Tang Clan.

20:13.830 --> 20:14.810
We just need to

20:14.880 --> 20:16.060
wait for Tang Lianyue to find us.

20:20.270 --> 20:20.940
Don't worry.

20:21.510 --> 20:22.260
We still remember

20:22.750 --> 20:23.890
your goal.

20:41.880 --> 20:42.540
Master Su.

20:42.880 --> 20:43.810
The members of Tang Clan have arrived.

20:46.350 --> 20:46.980
Yes, sir.

20:49.070 --> 20:49.740
Who are you?

20:49.780 --> 20:50.550
[Tang Xuan, Tang Clan]

20:50.550 --> 20:51.300
I'm Tang Xuan.

20:52.030 --> 20:52.780
Where's Tang Lianyue?

20:53.480 --> 20:55.570
Vice Master Tang was taken away before Lianyue

20:55.750 --> 20:56.850
arrived at Execution Hall.

20:57.200 --> 20:57.890
After Lianyue heard about it,

20:58.270 --> 20:59.410
he and Xueyue Sword Deity

20:59.430 --> 21:00.410
went to pursue him.

21:00.590 --> 21:01.500
Before his departure,

21:01.550 --> 21:02.740
he requested me to thank

21:03.030 --> 21:04.170
the members of Blood River.

21:05.680 --> 21:06.650
Is that all?

21:08.270 --> 21:09.260
Where's Baicao, then?

21:09.790 --> 21:10.850
King of Medicine

21:10.850 --> 21:12.410
was confined in a secret chamber before this.

21:12.480 --> 21:13.980
When Vice Master Tang was taken away,

21:14.110 --> 21:15.130
he was also released

21:15.130 --> 21:16.090
on purpose.

21:17.000 --> 21:18.410
He's resting in the medicine room now.

21:18.590 --> 21:19.460
I came here to notify you all.

21:20.270 --> 21:22.060
It seems like the work of martial niece of mine.

21:22.400 --> 21:23.460
They took Tang Linghuang away

21:23.720 --> 21:24.740
because his body

21:24.920 --> 21:26.370
was the perfect medicinal vessel.

21:26.680 --> 21:27.700
Later, I'll give him a diagnosis

21:27.790 --> 21:28.610
at Tang Clan.

21:28.750 --> 21:29.780
Please send him back

21:29.790 --> 21:31.190
to Medicine King Valley after that.

21:34.350 --> 21:35.090
Thank you.

21:37.310 --> 21:38.610
Is that all from Tang Lianyue?

21:40.240 --> 21:41.780
I'm sure you all are here

21:41.830 --> 21:43.510
for other purposes.

21:43.590 --> 21:45.090
And, Grand Master Tang hasn't returned from his trip.

21:45.440 --> 21:46.740
Neither Vice Master Tang nor Lianyue is around as well.

21:47.160 --> 21:48.020
If you need anything,

21:49.830 --> 21:50.740
you may discuss it with me.

21:52.720 --> 21:53.740
Discuss it with you?

21:54.720 --> 21:55.890
Who do you think you are?

21:55.900 --> 21:56.900
Do you think you have the right to speak with us?

21:57.270 --> 21:57.980
Patriarch,

21:59.160 --> 22:00.300
what do you mean by that?

22:01.110 --> 22:02.540
I feel the same as Changhe.

22:03.310 --> 22:04.170
Who do you think you are?

22:04.920 --> 22:05.780
You have no right to speak with us.

22:06.590 --> 22:07.300
Scram.

22:08.830 --> 22:10.060
Go back and tell Tang Lianyue this.

22:11.200 --> 22:12.610
If he wishes to see us,

22:13.310 --> 22:14.410
tell him to come to Blood River.

22:23.440 --> 22:24.740
I've put my Tracking Spider on him.

22:25.200 --> 22:26.060
I will find you

22:26.200 --> 22:27.220
no matter where you are.

22:29.700 --> 22:32.500
[20 Days Later]

22:36.380 --> 22:38.220
[Tianqi City]

22:38.220 --> 22:41.540
[At the Autumn Equinox, day and night are equal, while you and I are apart]

22:57.920 --> 22:58.810
Guardian Azure Dragon?

22:59.350 --> 23:00.260
The Undertaker?

23:06.550 --> 23:07.850
Muyu, oh, Muyu.

23:08.400 --> 23:10.460
I suppose everyone in the world

23:10.920 --> 23:12.500
is hostile toward Blood River.

23:14.160 --> 23:14.810
Patriarch,

23:15.280 --> 23:16.020
please don't be reckless.

23:16.480 --> 23:18.610
Am I being reckless just for trying to spar with

23:19.200 --> 23:20.220
the successor of the Heart Sword?

23:26.240 --> 23:27.890
I am Su Changhe, Patriarch of Blood River.

23:28.400 --> 23:30.740
Guardian Azure Dragon, it's an honor to meet you in Tianqi City.

23:31.310 --> 23:32.060
Please inform him

23:32.510 --> 23:33.370
of my arrival.

23:34.240 --> 23:34.980
Inform him?

23:35.680 --> 23:36.500
I wish to see

23:36.920 --> 23:38.220
Prince of Langya.

23:43.480 --> 23:44.520
For the past few centuries,

23:44.550 --> 23:46.500
martial artists feared and respected

23:46.500 --> 23:47.780
Blood River.

23:48.400 --> 23:49.130
You guys

23:49.790 --> 23:51.170
are the blades of darkness.

23:51.480 --> 23:53.460
You show up unannounced to take one's life.

23:55.160 --> 23:56.740
I am Guardian Azure Dragon of Tianqi.

23:57.400 --> 23:59.060
My duty is to protect the city.

23:59.750 --> 24:00.540
Therefore,

24:01.550 --> 24:02.220
I'm sorry.

24:03.400 --> 24:04.740
I unleashed the defensive sword energy

24:05.070 --> 24:05.940
due to my duty.

24:06.160 --> 24:07.020
I don't care about that.

24:09.590 --> 24:10.500
However, Su Muyu

24:10.920 --> 24:11.850
might care about that.

24:14.590 --> 24:15.980
My daughter encountered the Umbrella Ghost

24:16.440 --> 24:17.500
in Tang Fort before.

24:18.920 --> 24:20.260
Now, he's the head of Su family.

24:21.920 --> 24:22.740
Fine.

24:24.270 --> 24:25.410
Master Su said

24:25.880 --> 24:27.500
that they were involved in the uprising of Tang Clan.

24:27.960 --> 24:28.810
But it was obvious

24:29.480 --> 24:31.220
that they sided with Tang Lianyue.

24:31.830 --> 24:33.700
They rescued Tang Lianyue.

24:34.550 --> 24:35.810
Due to that,

24:37.000 --> 24:38.090
we're indebted to him.

24:38.960 --> 24:40.300
Hanyi was able to find Tang Lianyue after that.

24:41.030 --> 24:41.780
But at the same time,

24:42.200 --> 24:43.410
Tang Linghuang was taken away

24:43.550 --> 24:44.700
by a group of mysterious figures.

24:45.480 --> 24:46.940
They pursued them northward.

24:47.240 --> 24:48.130
However, there were still traces

24:48.480 --> 24:49.700
of the Frostmoon Cocoon's toxin

24:49.750 --> 24:50.650
within Lianyue's body.

24:51.070 --> 24:53.020
They were forced to stop halfway.

24:53.920 --> 24:54.740
After that,

24:55.830 --> 24:57.540
they lost Tang Linghuang's trail.

24:58.030 --> 24:58.940
Tang Linghuang was taken

24:59.240 --> 25:00.570
to Tianqi City.

25:02.510 --> 25:03.890
The scouts of Inner Security Division also said

25:04.030 --> 25:05.840
that a group of mysterious figures

25:05.840 --> 25:06.800
entered Tianqi City not long ago.

25:07.310 --> 25:08.130
But soon after,

25:08.240 --> 25:09.740
they managed to shake off their surveillance.

25:10.440 --> 25:12.220
Hanyi returned to Xueyue City as she didn't want

25:12.220 --> 25:13.330
to be involved with Tianqi.

25:14.000 --> 25:15.610
Lianyue and I continued our investigation.

25:16.070 --> 25:16.890
We suspect

25:17.110 --> 25:18.020
that the group of mysterious figures

25:18.200 --> 25:19.220
were the ones who abducted Tang Linghuang.

25:19.750 --> 25:21.740
Right when we intended to investigate this case further,

25:22.640 --> 25:23.850
you guys entered Tianqi.

25:24.920 --> 25:26.020
We can help you guys

25:26.200 --> 25:27.020
to locate them.

25:30.590 --> 25:31.890
So, you guys are here

25:32.880 --> 25:34.700
to make a deal with us, am I right?

25:35.110 --> 25:36.020
Speaking of which,

25:36.350 --> 25:38.170
we need to settle some debts with them.

25:39.400 --> 25:40.630
You see, with my personality,

25:40.630 --> 25:42.170
I would've gotten rid of them.

25:43.110 --> 25:44.540
But Su Muyu?

25:45.440 --> 25:46.170
He said

25:46.720 --> 25:48.220
this was an excellent opportunity.

25:51.440 --> 25:52.260
What opportunity?

25:52.720 --> 25:54.700
An opportunity to become friends with Prince of Langya.

25:55.480 --> 25:56.740
Actually, I don't care about it at all.

25:57.480 --> 25:59.610
I'm an arrogant fellow who's full of myself.

26:00.110 --> 26:01.570
How could I become friends

26:01.640 --> 26:02.940
with a shining hero

26:03.030 --> 26:03.980
like Prince of Langya?

26:04.680 --> 26:06.170
But Su Muyu already said so.

26:07.790 --> 26:10.020
Why do you listen to him?

26:14.030 --> 26:14.940
What did he say?

26:16.030 --> 26:16.890
Su Muyu said

26:17.070 --> 26:18.740
he wanted Blood River and Prince of Langya to become friends,

26:18.790 --> 26:20.220
not me.

26:20.920 --> 26:21.610
Therefore,

26:22.110 --> 26:22.850
he told me to shut up.

26:24.830 --> 26:25.850
Isn't this ridiculous?

26:26.750 --> 26:28.650
Who's the Patriarch here? He? Or I?

26:28.920 --> 26:29.850
Why should I shut up?

26:30.400 --> 26:31.410
I'm not going to shut up.

26:32.200 --> 26:33.090
I'm not willing to shut up.

26:33.480 --> 26:34.190
I don't care at all.

26:35.350 --> 26:36.740
I scoff at it.

26:36.880 --> 26:38.300
I sneer at it.

26:38.790 --> 26:39.370
I...

26:41.350 --> 26:42.700
I yield.

26:44.000 --> 26:45.020
Therefore, Guardian Azure Dragon,

26:45.680 --> 26:47.410
please inform

26:47.920 --> 26:49.020
Prince of Langya

26:49.680 --> 26:50.650
that I'm seeking an audience with him.

26:51.310 --> 26:52.260
What's your goal?

26:53.270 --> 26:54.300
As for my goal,

26:54.680 --> 26:55.940
I wish to tell him face-to-face.

26:57.000 --> 26:57.810
Guardian Azure Dragon,

26:58.400 --> 26:59.570
you merely need to inform him.

27:00.310 --> 27:01.560
Where's Master Su,

27:01.560 --> 27:02.650
whose power surpasses even yours?

27:04.310 --> 27:05.650
Him?

27:06.000 --> 27:07.330
He needs to wake up early for a house-viewing session tomorrow.

27:07.480 --> 27:08.890
Therefore, he's already asleep.

27:13.110 --> 27:13.570
Come.

27:13.680 --> 27:14.300
Over here.

27:14.590 --> 27:16.090
I'll take you guys to the unit now.

27:16.440 --> 27:17.540
It's warm during winter and cool during summer.

27:17.720 --> 27:18.790
And, it's located in a lively area.

27:19.110 --> 27:20.980
It'll satisfy your wish to have guests over

27:21.050 --> 27:23.020
and still keep your privacy.

27:23.480 --> 27:25.220
The previous two guests who lived here

27:25.350 --> 27:26.810
all struck it rich.

27:27.310 --> 27:28.060
I believe

27:28.440 --> 27:29.090
that you and your wife

27:29.310 --> 27:30.170
will surely be able to achieve the same.

27:30.550 --> 27:31.920
Didn't I tell you already?

27:31.920 --> 27:33.220
We aren't a couple.

27:33.510 --> 27:35.260
We're merely business partners.

27:35.550 --> 27:36.460
I understand.

27:36.750 --> 27:37.980
A gifted man and a graceful lady.

27:38.160 --> 27:39.090
A perfect couple like you two

27:39.550 --> 27:41.060
came all the way to Tianqi to open an apothecary.

27:41.400 --> 27:42.330
And now, you say that you're merely business partners?

27:42.920 --> 27:43.890
I'll never believe that.

27:44.350 --> 27:44.940
I'm sure you two

27:44.960 --> 27:46.090
are members of noble families

27:46.350 --> 27:47.170
who stole some money from the family

27:47.750 --> 27:48.850
and eloped all the way here.

27:49.720 --> 27:50.300
I...

27:53.510 --> 27:54.300
Don't worry.

27:54.510 --> 27:55.330
I won't tell anyone about it.

27:55.680 --> 27:56.570
My lips are sealed.

27:56.920 --> 27:58.090
That's not convincing at all.

27:58.960 --> 27:59.570
Come.

27:59.750 --> 28:00.460
Over here, please.

28:08.550 --> 28:09.260
Please.

28:13.790 --> 28:14.370
Here.

28:14.590 --> 28:15.810
What do you think about this unit?

28:19.830 --> 28:21.060
This residence is pretty good.

28:21.510 --> 28:22.850
It's pretty quiet.

28:23.400 --> 28:25.500
I just don't know if business here will be good.

28:27.590 --> 28:28.650
As for that,

28:29.160 --> 28:30.570
that'll depend on you.

28:32.270 --> 28:33.260
What do you think about your medical skills?

28:34.310 --> 28:36.020
I'm one of the top five physicians in the world.

28:37.750 --> 28:38.940
Where are the other four, then?

28:39.960 --> 28:42.300
I don't think they're in Tianqi City.

28:43.550 --> 28:45.260
I suppose this place isn't secluded enough

28:45.790 --> 28:47.170
to hide your popularity.

28:48.550 --> 28:49.650
He and his slick tongue.

28:50.400 --> 28:51.570
How much per month?

28:52.830 --> 28:53.460
Per month?

28:53.830 --> 28:54.980
We don't rent this place out in months.

28:55.200 --> 28:56.020
Only in years.

28:56.720 --> 28:59.060
You guys came all the way here to open an apothecary.

28:59.440 --> 29:00.570
How could you only rent it for one month?

29:01.350 --> 29:02.170
What about half a year?

29:02.720 --> 29:04.170
I don't think we'll be staying here for long.

29:08.110 --> 29:09.060
Yeah.

29:09.640 --> 29:11.410
I don't really like the climate here.

29:11.920 --> 29:13.170
Nan'an City suits me better.

29:14.110 --> 29:16.060
And, the osmanthus cakes here aren't nice at all.

29:16.440 --> 29:17.300
Why don't

29:17.830 --> 29:18.780
we

29:20.070 --> 29:20.740
forget about it?

29:22.400 --> 29:23.890
Half a year, huh?

29:24.830 --> 29:25.540
Fine, then.

29:26.400 --> 29:27.500
Half a year of rent

29:28.830 --> 29:29.700
will cost you 200 silver taels.

29:32.160 --> 29:33.170
It's that expensive?

29:34.200 --> 29:35.570
This is Tianqi City, you know?

29:36.270 --> 29:37.780
It's the busiest city in the world.

29:38.440 --> 29:39.570
200 silver taels,

29:41.030 --> 29:41.980
it's a great bargain.

29:42.350 --> 29:43.600
You're calling this a great bargain?

29:43.920 --> 29:44.430
You...

29:44.430 --> 29:45.170
What?

29:45.720 --> 29:46.610
It costs 200 silver taels

29:46.880 --> 29:47.890
to rent this lousy place?

29:48.750 --> 29:49.130
Go away.

29:49.200 --> 29:50.330
- Second Master Tu. - Mr. Su.

29:50.640 --> 29:52.460
Why did you find a lousy place as such?

29:52.550 --> 29:53.410
Come with me.

29:53.680 --> 29:54.850
I have a huge unit

29:54.920 --> 29:55.850
within Qile Pleasure House.

29:55.960 --> 29:57.220
It's ten times the size

29:57.310 --> 29:57.980
of this unit.

29:58.070 --> 29:59.650
I have 80 servants there.

29:59.650 --> 30:01.220
You won't need to worry about a single thing living there.

30:01.440 --> 30:02.410
You can just live there.

30:02.590 --> 30:03.460
If you like the place,

30:03.640 --> 30:04.330
you can have it.

30:04.680 --> 30:05.780
If you don't like the place,

30:05.920 --> 30:06.850
if you like somewhere that's quieter,

30:07.110 --> 30:07.780
I have a mountain villa

30:07.960 --> 30:08.980
on the outskirts.

30:09.400 --> 30:11.330
It's 30 times the size of this unit.

30:11.400 --> 30:12.650
There's even a hunting ground inside.

30:12.720 --> 30:13.810
Come, I'll take you there.

30:13.920 --> 30:14.780
Second Master Tu, thank you so much.

30:15.310 --> 30:15.980
But it's fine.

30:16.440 --> 30:17.370
This place is pretty nice.

30:18.000 --> 30:19.460
We came here to open an apothecary.

30:19.680 --> 30:20.740
It'll be inconvenient for us

30:20.790 --> 30:21.610
if the unit is too big.

30:22.070 --> 30:23.410
We should stay down-to-earth.

30:24.000 --> 30:25.630
It'll be troublesome

30:25.630 --> 30:26.650
if the patients are too intimidated

30:27.030 --> 30:28.090
by its sheer size to come inside.

30:29.480 --> 30:29.980
You have a point.

30:30.310 --> 30:31.330
This place will do, then.

30:32.590 --> 30:34.850
Which estate agency do you work for?

30:35.640 --> 30:37.940
Greetings, Second Master Tu.

30:38.400 --> 30:40.020
I'm an estate broker

30:40.350 --> 30:41.260
for Home of Love.

30:41.350 --> 30:42.260
Never heard of it before.

30:42.830 --> 30:43.940
This is my friend.

30:45.240 --> 30:45.890
Give him a cheaper price.

30:46.440 --> 30:47.130
If so...

30:47.790 --> 30:48.570
What about one...

30:48.880 --> 30:49.540
How much?

30:49.920 --> 30:50.780
One silver tael.

30:55.750 --> 30:56.740
One silver tael?

30:57.720 --> 30:58.260
That's right.

30:58.920 --> 31:00.130
My main intention

31:00.680 --> 31:01.500
is to befriend Second Master Tu.

31:02.110 --> 31:02.980
You think you can befriend me

31:03.000 --> 31:04.020
with such a meager amount?

31:05.110 --> 31:05.700
That's not it, Second Master Tu.

31:05.720 --> 31:06.740
I suppose you got yourself a great bargain.

31:08.200 --> 31:09.260
Find some of your men

31:09.400 --> 31:10.060
and help my friend

31:10.110 --> 31:11.540
renovate the unit tomorrow.

31:12.550 --> 31:13.170
Mr. Su,

31:13.440 --> 31:14.510
when do you guys plan

31:14.510 --> 31:15.330
to open the apothecary?

31:15.680 --> 31:16.610
In three days.

31:17.270 --> 31:18.130
Did you hear him?

31:18.350 --> 31:18.940
I did.

31:19.110 --> 31:19.890
Go and hire more help.

31:20.200 --> 31:20.890
Understood.

31:21.110 --> 31:22.850
I'll get to it immediately.

31:27.750 --> 31:28.410
Mr. Su.

31:28.920 --> 31:30.740
Why did you return to Tianqi City

31:30.880 --> 31:31.780
all of a sudden?

31:33.240 --> 31:34.170
I came here to get in someone's good graces.

31:35.480 --> 31:36.410
Who?

31:37.160 --> 31:37.810
Prince of Langya.

31:41.640 --> 31:42.650
I suppose

31:43.350 --> 31:44.700
he's a man among man, huh?

31:48.160 --> 31:48.740
Here.

31:51.030 --> 31:51.740
Mr. Su,

31:52.590 --> 31:53.540
why is Blood River

31:53.830 --> 31:54.980
looking for Prince of Langya?

31:55.350 --> 31:57.130
Are you guys preparing for something huge?

31:58.030 --> 31:58.980
What do you mean?

31:59.720 --> 32:00.610
For example,

32:02.110 --> 32:02.890
staging a rebellion.

32:03.480 --> 32:04.130
Staging a rebellion?

32:04.880 --> 32:05.650
May I join you guys?

32:06.440 --> 32:07.060
No.

32:07.830 --> 32:08.810
What a shame.

32:09.680 --> 32:10.500
I mean,

32:10.590 --> 32:11.780
we aren't here to stage a rebellion.

32:12.750 --> 32:14.170
Why are you guys looking for Prince of Langya, then?

32:15.400 --> 32:16.850
Do you think a person like Prince of Langya

32:17.200 --> 32:18.330
will stage a rebellion?

32:20.270 --> 32:21.500
Not in the past, he won't.

32:22.310 --> 32:23.170
But now,

32:23.790 --> 32:25.090
I think it's a little different.

32:27.400 --> 32:28.260
What's so different about it?

32:30.030 --> 32:31.260
Lately, rumors have been circulating

32:31.510 --> 32:32.460
in Tianqi City.

32:32.960 --> 32:33.700
Rumor has it

32:33.790 --> 32:35.700
that his name was contained within

32:36.030 --> 32:37.370
the Dragonseal Scroll he tore apart back then.

32:39.030 --> 32:40.710
Who in Tianqi City

32:40.710 --> 32:41.810
is bold enough to spread such a rumor?

32:41.840 --> 32:42.980
You're right.

32:43.680 --> 32:44.870
Back then, Prince of Langya invaded Tai'an Palace

32:44.870 --> 32:45.850
with his army.

32:45.850 --> 32:46.800
He obtained the Dragonseal Scroll

32:46.800 --> 32:48.300
from the late emperor.

32:48.480 --> 32:49.330
After that, he announced

32:49.440 --> 32:51.170
that the late emperor had passed the throne to Xiao Ruojin,

32:51.350 --> 32:53.090
which is the current Emperor Mingde.

32:53.440 --> 32:54.300
But you need to know this.

32:54.590 --> 32:55.650
There were always

32:55.720 --> 32:57.090
two Dragonseal Scrolls.

32:57.350 --> 32:58.940
One of them was ripped apart

32:59.000 --> 32:59.610
by Prince of Langya

32:59.680 --> 33:00.460
outside Tai'an Palace back then.

33:00.750 --> 33:01.610
As for the other one,

33:01.750 --> 33:03.300
it was supposed to be delivered to the Imperial Astronomical Bureau

33:03.350 --> 33:04.330
by the messenger eunuch.

33:04.590 --> 33:06.370
However, the bureau never received the scroll.

33:06.590 --> 33:07.540
And, the messenger eunuch

33:07.830 --> 33:08.700
went missing as well.

33:10.880 --> 33:12.300
This rumor has existed since the beginning.

33:12.790 --> 33:13.850
Prince of Langya

33:13.960 --> 33:15.330
didn't need to rip the scroll apart

33:15.590 --> 33:17.410
if Xiao Ruojin's name was within it.

33:18.510 --> 33:19.370
It was merely because

33:19.480 --> 33:20.540
he possessed immense military strength back then.

33:20.750 --> 33:21.980
If anyone refused to comply,

33:22.070 --> 33:23.330
they wouldn't have survived the night.

33:23.750 --> 33:24.540
That's why no one

33:24.550 --> 33:25.650
dared to mention it again

33:25.790 --> 33:26.940
after the incident.

33:27.270 --> 33:28.650
Therefore,

33:29.200 --> 33:30.260
now that the rumors are starting to circulate again,

33:31.030 --> 33:33.170
I'm sure someone is spreading them on purpose.

33:34.270 --> 33:35.570
Who do you think is the culprit, then?

33:36.110 --> 33:37.780
I think it's Prince of Langya himself.

33:38.310 --> 33:39.460
Now, he has conquered all three areas of Nanjue,

33:39.480 --> 33:40.220
and has rendered numerous merits.

33:40.350 --> 33:42.220
He's already the top figure of Beili's military.

33:43.240 --> 33:43.940
His fame rivals that of

33:44.000 --> 33:45.300
the founding emperor of Beili,

33:45.480 --> 33:46.570
Xiao Yi, also known as Emperor Tianwu.

33:47.160 --> 33:48.460
And, the army under him

33:48.550 --> 33:49.700
is already raring to act.

33:50.110 --> 33:51.650
They want him to be the emperor.

33:52.510 --> 33:54.060
Perhaps back then, Prince of Langya

33:54.240 --> 33:55.170
truly intended

33:55.270 --> 33:56.130
to support his elder brother.

33:56.550 --> 33:58.220
But people change, you know?

33:58.790 --> 34:00.460
Especially for those who stand at the peak for a long time.

34:00.880 --> 34:01.740
It gets lonely up there.

34:02.350 --> 34:02.940
After all,

34:03.440 --> 34:04.700
I'm sure everyone will strive for a higher position.

34:05.400 --> 34:07.060
Just like how Second Master Tu

34:07.680 --> 34:09.060
intends to replace First Master Tu.

34:10.590 --> 34:11.820
Miss Bai, that's nonsense.

34:11.960 --> 34:13.340
That's definitely nonsense.

34:13.760 --> 34:14.820
It was just a joke.

34:15.840 --> 34:16.940
It seems my prediction is correct.

34:18.030 --> 34:19.290
Mr. Su, what was your prediction?

34:19.880 --> 34:20.730
We encountered

34:20.840 --> 34:21.650
some troublesome opponents

34:22.760 --> 34:24.130
during our fight with Tang Clan in Sihuai City.

34:25.360 --> 34:26.170
Although

34:26.190 --> 34:26.940
we aren't their targets,

34:27.190 --> 34:28.020
we found out

34:29.070 --> 34:29.860
that

34:29.920 --> 34:31.020
they were plotting something big.

34:31.800 --> 34:33.290
Combining the news you gave us just now,

34:33.960 --> 34:34.860
I suppose

34:36.480 --> 34:38.060
they were trying to deal with Prince of Langya.

34:40.710 --> 34:41.610
Thank you, Second Master Tu.

34:43.230 --> 34:45.020
Mr. Su, if you require any help

34:45.150 --> 34:46.770
while you're in Tianqi City,

34:46.960 --> 34:47.860
just send your men

34:47.880 --> 34:49.290
to Thousand-Gold Tower and ask for my help.

34:49.510 --> 34:51.540
Second Master Tu, do you intend to befriend Blood River?

34:52.070 --> 34:53.340
Are you trying to get in our good graces?

34:54.230 --> 34:56.060
Mr. Su, we hit it off immediately during our first encounter.

34:56.280 --> 34:57.900
We're true friends. I'm not trying to curry favors here.

34:58.800 --> 34:59.420
You know this too.

34:59.800 --> 35:01.290
I've been living in this pretentious city

35:01.320 --> 35:02.060
called Tianqi for a long time.

35:02.590 --> 35:04.250
I especially treasure that feeling of

35:04.590 --> 35:05.610
hitting it off at first sight.

35:09.110 --> 35:09.860
Moreover,

35:10.280 --> 35:12.570
Mr. Su, you've saved me before.

35:15.550 --> 35:17.020
Where did you guys hit it off at first sight?

35:19.070 --> 35:20.130
Of course it's on the Entertainment Street.

35:20.670 --> 35:21.730
The tavern was filled with drunken guests.

35:21.960 --> 35:22.900
Only Mr. Su and I

35:22.960 --> 35:23.770
remained untempted.

35:27.020 --> 35:30.500
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

35:30.540 --> 35:34.420
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

35:36.260 --> 35:39.740
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

35:39.780 --> 35:43.620
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

35:45.620 --> 35:48.900
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

35:49.020 --> 35:51.100
♪Still I can't let go♪

35:51.260 --> 35:54.700
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

35:55.180 --> 35:57.380
♪My heart no longer my own♪

35:57.500 --> 36:02.500
♪No one can escape from love♪

36:19.100 --> 36:22.820
♪How many hidden feelings♪

36:22.940 --> 36:27.020
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

36:28.260 --> 36:32.140
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

36:32.260 --> 36:36.500
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

36:37.620 --> 36:40.500
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

36:40.580 --> 36:44.820
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

36:47.100 --> 36:51.100
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

36:51.140 --> 36:54.580
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

